lass=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:#ffffff;line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/22/50494840/aa87edab41d4c34a330be941034a6127_5400809764036454746.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/22/50494840/cc96e1a87fed9d8a030c57148dd21210_1712504568953614080.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>驱动核心</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:#ffffff;line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/22/50494840/f3dc19e0e7f30d481bd53742dc2e62a2_6259377582664361004.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/22/50494840/cc96e1a87fed9d8a030c57148dd21210_3082100714479609180.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>驱动核心</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/12/02/50494840/bef404fe0b0cac7b8ea1a03c8ef5c227_5672640795058708963.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"width:775px;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/22/50494840/cc96e1a87fed9d8a030c57148dd21210_1791570265646617286.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>驱动核心</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:#ffffff;line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/27/50494840/100ee6a67b5025f68308b77f113c5ccb_7399162599908766367.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">十亿年后的曙光</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I&nbsp;/II&nbsp;/III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">敌人受到来自武器技攻击的全伤害提高<strong>(<span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">4.0%/8.0%/12.0%</span>)</strong>（该效果为独立加成）（唯一生效）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">太阳石</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">若装配佩戴者具有<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>界域共鸣</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;晴空霹雳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：角色的能力特性之一，拥有此特性的角色能够参与界域共鸣反应&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>特性，则造成武器技伤害时提高自身<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">20.0%</span></strong>雷电元素伤害，持续6秒，重复触发刷新持续时间。深空定锚·曙光装备时，<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>晴空霹雳</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;晴空霹雳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：在&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;霹雳耀变&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;状态下，使用&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;霹雳攻击&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;命中敌人后下次&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;霹雳攻击&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;会被切换为晴空霹雳，深空定锚·曙光展开驱动核心上的利刃斩向敌人&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>和<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>雷光锚击</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;雷光锚击&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;星环爆发&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;期间的第一次&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;霹雳攻击&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;将升级为雷光锚击，深空定锚·曙光使用船锚砸向敌&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>为目标添加【霹雳残响】效果，使目标在0.6秒内额外受到<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">400.0%</span></strong>攻击力的雷电元素伤害，冷却时间12秒，<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>状态下，角色首次离场时提前移除冷却时间（每次进入<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>状态时都会获得此效果）。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">18月38日</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">非<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>状态下，场上敌人受到来自自身雷电元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">6.0%</span></strong>。深空定锚·曙光装备时，星之环激活时场上敌人受到的全元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">6.0%</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">材料-消耗品</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">开启<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/3845/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">锋光明锐自选箱</a>、<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/3847/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color:rgba(245, 247, 250, 0.847)\">华彩璀耀自选箱</span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgba(245, 247, 250, 0.847)\">兑换获得</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">装备补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">消耗</span><a href=\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"a\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">兑换获得</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">作战凭证</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">第五十期（V8.2）作战工坊限时兑换</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 4;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <thead><tr><th>突破等级</th> <th colspan=\"5\">所需材料</th></tr></thead> 